  bootwright / sbom
      Export this executable's software bill of materials as one CycloneDX JSON document: what
      the executable carries (its Go modules and toolchain, the controller runtime's wheels and
      the embedded automation) and what it pins and acquires at use (the default target clients
      and the managed services' and emulated BMC's images), each with its version and digest.
      It reads no context and contacts nothing.

  Usage
    bootwright sbom [flags]

  Command flags
      --format  Select the bill of materials format (values: cyclonedx-json) (required)

  Common flags
      --ascii       Use ASCII status markers
      --color       Select terminal colors (values: auto, always, never) · default auto
      --detail      Select human detail (values: compact, full) · default compact
      -h, --help    Show help for this command
      -o, --output  Select output mode (values: text, json, yaml) · default text
      --progress    Select progress animation (values: auto, always, never) · default auto
      --width       Set presentation width (0: automatic) · default 0

  Examples
    bootwright sbom --format cyclonedx-json
